# vision.md — Canonical Institutional Python Trading System (Repo Vision)

This file is **architecture-as-communication**.
A reader must understand the system in < 2 minutes.

Source of truth:
- `flow.md` defines canonical runtime flows
- `architecture.md` defines boundaries and responsibilities
- This `vision.md` defines the **ideal repo shape** that makes those boundaries obvious

If code does not fit cleanly into exactly one box in the pipeline, it belongs in the wrong place.

---

## 1) North Star Pipeline (Maps 1:1 to packages)

┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Market Data & Normalization  │  → trading/md/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ State Builders               │  → trading/state/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Alpha / Signal Layer         │  → trading/alpha/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Portfolio Construction       │  → trading/portfolio/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Risk & Limits Engine         │  → trading/risk/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ OMS (Order State Machine)    │  → trading/oms/*   (CORE)
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Execution / Routing          │  → trading/execution/*
└───────────────┬──────────────┘
                ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ Exchange Connectivity        │  → trading/adapters/*
└──────────────────────────────┘

Cross-cutting:
- events & replay → trading/events/*
- posttrade → trading/posttrade/*
- observability → trading/obs/*
- operational controls → trading/ops/*
- shared primitives → trading/common/*

